abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization (437 kernel-verified theorems across 17 modules, 0 sorry,
  only standard axioms [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]) and 19-page
  companion manuscript by Benjamin Stanley Frohman establishing a verified
  non-vacuous conditional reduction for 3D incompressible Navier–Stokes global
  regularity via the Frohmanian Symplectic Tether (frohmanian_tether_theorem,
  global_regularity_for_NS, global_regularity_for_NS_nonvacuous_at_zero,
  SymplecticConstraint.lean, TorusStrainExclusion.lean, HighSetDepletionAndBKM.lean).
